# Tony Hawk's Pro Skater 2x (41560001), Thor. DRAFT by lane.routeprep,
# 2026-09-26, not played. NO FRAMES ON DISK for this title: every step is
# [guess] or [recalled]. One file: Free Skate needs no career save.
#
# Aim [recalled, medium]: FREE SKATE -- no timer and no goals, so the window
# holds only skating. The series' main menu lists Career, Single Session,
# Free Skate, ...; the draft moves down twice from the first item. Then a
# skater select (A) and a level select (A, the first level).
#
# Adopted by lane.titleroutes 2026-09-30 (session 42) unchanged in its steps
# except where noted, and queued as a Thor screening soak (<= 480 s, the
# fan-dead Thor's cold-slot runner): NOT YET REPLAYED. Every step leaves a
# frame, so a soak that misses gameplay is the survey that revises it.
wait 30
shot boot30
press START                 # [guess] skip logos / intro FMV
wait 15
shot boot45
press START
wait 15
shot boot60
press START                 # [guess] the title prompt
wait 8
shot after-title            # OPEN: a "no save found / create?" prompt
press A                     # [guess] accept it, or pick the first menu item
wait 8
shot main-menu              # CHECK: which item is highlighted; Career should be first
mark booted
axis LY max                 # [recalled] down: Single Session
wait 0.15
axis LY mid
wait 0.6
axis LY max                 # [recalled] down: Free Skate
wait 0.15
axis LY mid
wait 0.6
shot on-free-skate
press A
wait 6
shot skater-select
press A
wait 6
shot level-select
press A
wait 20
shot loading
# Session 46 (frame review): the old mark sat HERE, and the screen here is
# THE HANGAR CHECKLIST (goal list, "A Accept / B Back"), not skating
# (1790808339-titleroutes-3127689, 160005-gameplay.png). That screen's 97.6%
# at 59.82 measured the menu. A accepts it [guess: the level then loads].
press A
wait 15
shot after-checklist
axis LY min
wait 4
axis LY mid
shot rolling
mark gameplay               # [guess] after the checklist; CHECK rolling.png shows the skater in the Hangar
# Push, jump (A), flip/grab (X/B) and turn: bails are fine, the level keeps going.
repeat forever {
    axis LY min
    wait 1.5
    press A
    wait 0.4
    press X
    wait 0.6
    axis LX max
    wait 1
    press A
    wait 0.4
    press B
    wait 0.6
    axis LX min
    wait 1
    axis LX mid
    axis LY mid
    wait 0.3
}
